    ZB-29 package 2b: viewer mount for registered snowmen (night drive + pat action)
    
    Mounts the snowman scene into the ground landscape, drives the night
    plan on ZB-17 phase changes (local player gaze as observer), eases head
    turns per frame, and offers a pat interaction next to a registered
    snowman. Viewer is a one-writer public file: this commit is the local
    staging record; the same change ships to window A as a patch segment
    for its public batch.

